{"version":3,"term":{"cols":80,"rows":24},"timestamp":1788728965,"command":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-moi-lazy-ants-development-mcp-transkribus-mcp-server/41ed9271-a35f-4ae8-83f6-dce052ea8cf7/scratchpad/smoke-keyring.sh","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.011, "o", "== 1. store fake credentials, from the same runtime that reads them ==\r\n"]
[0.085, "o", "stored: user, password\r\n"]
[0.015, "o", "\r\n== 2. keyring wins over the environment ==\r\n"]
[0.122, "o", "{ userFromKeyring: \u001b[33mtrue\u001b[39m, passwordFromKeyring: \u001b[33mtrue\u001b[39m, sessionId: \u001b[1mnull\u001b[22m }\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "\r\n== 3. delete the password entry: that value alone falls back to the env ==\r\n"]
[0.321, "o", "{ userFromKeyring: \u001b[33mtrue\u001b[39m, passwordFromEnv: \u001b[33mtrue\u001b[39m }\r\n"]
[0.071, "o", "\r\n== 4. nothing in either source: a secret-free error ==\r\n"]
[0.290, "o", "No Transkribus credentials found. Provide them via one of:\r\n  • OS keyring: service \"transkribus-mcp\" (override with TRANSKRIBUS_KEYRING_SERVICE), accounts \"user\" + \"password\", or \"session-id\"\r\n  • Environment variables: TRANSKRIBUS_USER + TRANSKRIBUS_PASSWORD, or TRANSKRIBUS_SESSION_ID\r\n"]
[0.009, "o", "\r\n== 5. an unreadable entry does not hang the server ==\r\n   (an item created by /usr/bin/security needs a keychain dialog this\r\n    non-interactive shell cannot answer — the 5s deadline must win)\r\n"]
[5.218, "o", "{ resolvedInMs: \u001b[33m5005\u001b[39m, sessionIdFromEnv: \u001b[33mtrue\u001b[39m, user: \u001b[1mnull\u001b[22m }\r\n"]
[3.440, "o", "password has been deleted.\r\n"]
[0.018, "o", "\r\n== 6. no leftovers ==\r\n"]
[0.039, "o", "keychain clean\r\n"]
[0.000, "x", "0"]
